              "EXO.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Kut 4:22-32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mnamo usiku wa manane, Mwenyezi-Mungu aliwaua wazaliwa wa kwanza wote wa Misri. Wote walikufa, tangu mzaliwa wa kwanza wa Farao, mrithi wa ufalme, hadi mzaliwa wa kwanza wa mfungwa gerezani. Hata wazaliwa wa kwanza wa wanyama nao walikufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Farao, watumishi wake na wakazi wote wa Misri wakaamka usiku. Kukawa na kilio kikubwa nchini kote Misri kwa maana hapakuwa hata nyumba moja ambamo hakufa mtu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Farao akawaita Mose na Aroni, usiku huohuo, akamwambia, “Amkeni! Ondokeni miongoni mwa watu wangu. Nendeni, nyinyi pamoja na hao Waisraeli, mkamtumikie Mwenyezi-Mungu kama mlivyosema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chukueni makundi yenu ya kondoo na ng'ombe, mwondoke; niombeeni na mimi baraka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamisri wakawahimiza Waisraeli waondoke haraka, wakisema, “Hakika tutakufa sote!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Waisraeli wakauchukua unga wao uliokandwa kabla haujatiwa chachu, na mabakuli yao ya kukandia wakiwa wamezifunga kwa nguo na kubeba mabegani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Kut 3:21-22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Waisraeli walikuwa wamekwisha fanya kama Mose alivyowaagiza hapo awali: Waliwaomba Wamisri wawapatie vito vya fedha, dhahabu na mavazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mwenyezi-Mungu alikwisha wafanya Waisraeli wapendwe na Wamisri, nao Wamisri wakawapa kila kitu walichoomba. Ndivyo Waisraeli walivyowapokonya Wamisri mali yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli waliondoka mjini Ramesesi, wakasafiri kwa miguu kuelekea Sukothi. Walikuwa wanaume wapatao 600,000, licha ya wanawake na watoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulikuwa pia na kundi la watu wengine walioandamana nao pamoja na mifugo mingi, kondoo na ng'ombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kuwa walikuwa wameondoka Misri kwa haraka, hawakuweza kutayarisha chakula cha safarini, ila tu ule unga uliokandwa bila kutiwa chachu. Basi, wakaoka mikate isiyotiwa chachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
